al_business_count":8},{"category":"Cafes","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"pTpZS84EQhvZaxhq6SSWNw","review_id":"eNm48-Nd9VM_HVz2bcQBqQ","date":"2021-10-01T17:08:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9315720796585083,"text_excerpt":"I was literally here the entire day (felt like it). I came by for a virtual meeting & ordered an iced coffee. The WiFi wasn't working too good so I left for a while had lunch and returned to try the hibiscus mango tea, which was very tart, but still good & refreshing. I spent most of my time reading. It's such a bright, cozy, welcoming space. Dog friendly too!"},{"business_id":"pTpZS84EQhvZaxhq6SSWNw","review_id":"CbyNHkS8VpFJ_tY9MXvm8w","date":"2020-06-19T23:24:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9311537742614746,"text_excerpt":"We're excited to have this new coffee shop/cafe in the Bywater. It's beautiful inside with a couch and seating, they also have outdoor seating. Today they had live music outside which was awesome. Also happy hour half off coffee and espresso drinks. The iced coffee was great, they have grab and go burritos and salads (breakfast tacos and burritos from Rosalita's) We met the owner who was very nice. Also our puppy loved the dog treats and water bowl. We'll definitely be back."},{"business_id":"pTpZS84EQhvZaxhq6SSWNw","review_id":"znun9hy_i1-AaX3v3oBanw","date":"2020-12-07T02:27:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9301475286483765,"text_excerpt":"solid study spot! so when i started to venture back out, this is one of a few spots where i felt I could tuck away at a corner table outside to do some work and feel ok. they also had doors and windows flung open to optimize all possible fresh air flow. of times i've been, 100% mask compliance by staff and guests for all inside interactions. the drinks are good, and they run a daily \"happy hour\" (well, hours) on caffeinated bevs in afternoon. i've also enjoyed the the pastry and food offerings (not sure if produced in house or via a vendor). you can get ham and butter sandwiches, tortes, really yummy pies, and even whole baguettes to take home."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"pTpZS84EQhvZaxhq6SSWNw","photo_id":"srNN92nIOSyZXWITyidqFg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/srNN92nIOSyZXWITyidqFg.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0000001192092896}]},"notebook_case":null}
